      "decision": "Decision: ssot-mcp delegated upgrade calls use the currently running ssot-mcp binary and installed ssot-core runtime. MCP upgrade normalization must not attempt to install, resolve, or treat schema versions as PyPI package versions. It should refresh packaged ADR and SPEC documents during upgrade.",
      "consequences": "Repo-owned document may be superseded through normal ADR flow",
