      "title": "TUI non-blocking registry loading",
      "parentAdrId": "adr:0523",
      "ruleDefinition": "ssot-tui shall load registries outside the UI event handler. A registry load includes path resolution, registry parsing, document/entity collection loading, and validation summary construction. While a load is pending, the current UI shall remain interactive and any already-loaded workspace shall remain visible. The TUI shall surface a loading status message. A newer load request shall supersede older pending load results. A failed load shall report an operator-readable error without clearing a previously loaded workspace.",
      "verificationSource": "ssot validate .",
      "description": "ssot-tui shall load registries outside the UI event handler. A registry load includes path resolution, registry parsing, document/entity collection loading, and validation summary construction. While a load is pending, the current UI shall remain interactive and any already-loaded workspace shall remain visible. The TUI shall surface a loading status message. A newer load request shall supersede older pending load results. A failed load shall report an operator-readable error without clearing a previously loaded workspace.",
      "body": "ssot-tui shall load registries outside the UI event handler. A registry load includes path resolution, registry parsing, document/entity collection loading, and validation summary construction. While a load is pending, the current UI shall remain interactive and any already-loaded workspace shall remain visible. The TUI shall surface a loading status message. A newer load request shall supersede older pending load results. A failed load shall report an operator-readable error without clearing a previously loaded workspace.",
      "spec_kind": "operational"
