      "description": "Supported horizons:",
      "body": "Supported horizons:\n- `current`\n- `next`\n- `future`\n- `explicit`\n- `backlog`\n- `out_of_bounds`\n\nHorizons answer *when* a feature or issue is targeted. They do not answer support lifecycle.",
      "spec_kind": "normative"
